            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "x-api-token",
              "value": "{{x-api-token}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns the list of either visible or hidden pipeline IDs for a specific role. For more information on pipeline visibility, please refer to the <a href=\"https://support.pipedrive.com/en/article/visibility-groups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visibility groups article</a>."
        },
        {
